--- /dev/null
+++ b/releasenotes/notes/config-read-at-use-da8ca3797a3d3202.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    The quota extensions now report the configured ``quota_driver`` rather
+    than the value it had when the extension module was imported, so
+    ``quotas`` advertises per project quotas and ``quota_details`` is offered
+    whenever a database quota driver is configured.
+  - |
+    The ORM "SQL execution without transaction" warning, which checks the
+    Neutron code for SQLAlchemy 2.0 compliance, is now enabled when the core
+    plugin is built rather than when ``neutron.objects.base`` is imported, so
+    it honours ``debug`` from the configuration file instead of its default.
